{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetRysX2DZ13xWNoZJyRF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All 20 tests pass. Let me verify the specific requirements:\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. **Existing build passes** ✓ — `./mvnw test` completes with BUILD SUCCESS, no new dependencies added\n2. **Existing tests pass** ✓ — All 20 tests run with 0 failures\n3. **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels CREATED shipments** ✓\n   - Test: `cancelsAnActiveOrder()` verifies 200 response with CANCELLED status\n   - Test: `cancelsCreatedShipmentsWhenOrderIsCancelled()` verifies shipments are cancelled\n4. **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** ✓\n   - Uses ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404)\n   - All errors follow `{\"error\": {\"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\"}}` envelope\n5. **A repeated cancel succeeds; blocked cancel changes nothing; unknown order is refused; shipment for cancelled order is refused** ✓\n   - Test: `retryingCancelOnAlreadyCancelledOrderSucceeds()` — idempotent\n   - Test: `cancelFailsWith409IfOrderHasConfirmedShipment()` — verifies order stays ACTIVE\n   - Test: `cancelReturns404ForNonExistentOrder()` — 404 case\n   - Test: `rejectsShipmentCreationForCancelledOrder()` — 409 for shipment on cancelled order\n6. **No new Maven dependency** ✓ — pom.xml unchanged\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** ✓ — Only modified order and shipment features and shared api package\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n- `Order.kt` — Added `OrderStatus` enum and `status` field with default ACTIVE. This is necessary for requirement.\n- `OrderController.kt` — Added cancel endpoint with full business logic. This is necessary for requirement.\n- `ApiError.kt` — Added two error codes: `ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT` and `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CREATED_FOR_CANCELLED_ORDER`. This is necessary for error handling.\n- `ShipmentRepository.kt` — Added `findByOrderId()` method. This is necessary to query shipments for an order during cancel.\n- `ShipmentController.kt` — Added check to reject shipment creation on cancelled orders. This is necessary for requirement.\n- `OrderControllerTest.kt` — Added 6 new tests covering all cancel scenarios. Necessary for verification.\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 1 test for shipment creation rejection. Necessary for verification.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements implemented, all tests passing.\n\nLet me verify that I haven't made any breaking changes to existing tests by reviewing the changes I made:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3338,"cache_read_input_tokens":36942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3338},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"71d5bc6d-7b17-4c6a-9933-b6aa5c9a1990","uuid":"4b537d22-1d22-4915-a5c4-d5b5d61a448e","timestamp":"2026-09-09T19:39:00.122Z","request_id":"req_011CetRyrq6aobQdSvDBa4Qf"}
