{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetS2La1ciYTCErCRPUvM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The verification is complete.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint that moves orders to CANCELLED status, cancels CREATED shipments, rejects if CONFIRMED shipments exist, allows retries on already-cancelled orders, and prevents new shipments on cancelled orders.\n\nChanged       Order.kt (added OrderStatus enum and status field)\n              OrderController.kt (added cancel endpoint with business logic)\n              ApiError.kt (added ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT and SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CREATED_FOR_CANCELLED_ORDER error codes)\n              ShipmentRepository.kt (added findByOrderId method)\n              ShipmentController.kt (added check to reject shipment creation on cancelled orders)\n              OrderControllerTest.kt (added 6 tests for cancel scenarios)\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt (added 1 test for shipment creation rejection)\n\nTests         cancelsAnActiveOrder() — verifies 200 response with CANCELLED status\n              cancelsCreatedShipmentsWhenOrderIsCancelled() — verifies CREATED shipments are transitioned to CANCELLED\n              retryingCancelOnAlreadyCancelledOrderSucceeds() — verifies idempotency\n              cancelFailsWith409IfOrderHasConfirmedShipment() — verifies all-or-nothing semantics and order stays ACTIVE\n              cancelReturns404ForNonExistentOrder() — verifies 404 response with correct error code\n              newOrderHasActiveStatus() — verifies new orders start in ACTIVE state\n              rejectsShipmentCreationForCancelledOrder() — verifies 409 when creating shipment on cancelled order\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test\n              Result: Tests run: 20, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, BUILD SUCCESS\n              All existing and new tests pass\n\nNot done      None — all